# Step 019 — WIRE_UI

```step
anchor: WIRE_UI
touches: [OpticalConstructor.App, OpticalConstructor.TestWindows, OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests]
depends_on: [9, 16]
```

**How to implement.** Finalize the composition root: in OpticalConstructor.App/Program.fs build CategoryProxy.createInMemory (its materialsReferencingCategory lookup backed by the materials store) beside the existing SampleProxy / MaterialProxy / Library / Experiments proxies (Program.fs:138-140) and inject all of them through initMainWith; the launcher path is otherwise unchanged. Verify the whole surface headless: the ui-smoke suite renders one frame for the reordered full-surface Materials and Library bays, the Selector / Experiments / Details bays, and the Material / Sample / Category editor windows without throwing.

**Acceptance.** After composition, launching the Main window MUST wire the in-memory CategoryProxy at the root beside the material/sample proxies, and the ui-smoke suite MUST render the reordered full-surface Materials and Library bays and all three editor windows without throwing, with every test gate at or above its baseline count.
